Created langchain-rag.js
Key Features:

LangChain Components:

OllamaEmbeddings - For generating embeddings using Ollama's nomic-embed-text model
Ollama LLM - For generating responses using llama3
RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter - For intelligent document chunking (1000 chars with 200 char overlap)
MemoryVectorStore - For in-memory vector storage
RetrievalQAChain - For creating an end-to-end QA pipeline
Key Improvements Over Original:

Automatic document chunking using LangChain's text splitter
Cleaner chain-based architecture
Built-in support for source document tracking
Customizable prompt templates
Better error handling and logging
Workflow:

Initializes LangChain components (embeddings & LLM)
Loads all documents from embeddings/docs
Splits documents into manageable chunks
Creates a vector store from chunks
Sets up a QA chain with custom prompting
Executes queries and returns answers with source documents
Updated package.json with LangChain dependencies:

@langchain/community - Community integrations
@langchain/core - Core LangChain components
langchain - Main library